  1035                              <1> copyMain:
  1036                              <1> ;This is the main copying procedure! 
  1037                              <1> ;Start by checking the two files are not the same. If so, complain!
  1038                              <1> ;If returns CF=CY, error code in al. 
  1039                              <1> ;   If al = -1, same filename error!
  1040                              <1> ;   If al = -2, Root Dir full (couldn't create file)
  1041                              <1> ;   If al = -3, attempted binary read from a device
  1042                              <1> ;If returns CF=NC, file copied successfully.
  1043                              <1> ;Check the two files are not the same using truename in searchspec
  1044 000026B8 488D35(11060000)    <1>     lea rsi, srcSpec
